    "detailed_description": "The candy Adventure<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on a delightful journey in The Candy Adventure, a charming 3D platformer. Join our adorable cake characters as they fall through a mysterious portal and find themselves in magical and unexpected locations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this sweet-themed adventure, you'll navigate through vibrant and colorful worlds, overcoming various challenges to find your way back home. Play solo or team up with a friend in our engaging cooperative mode, where collaboration and teamwork are essential for success.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience a blend of 3D platforming with captivating 2.5D levels, offering a unique twist to each stage. Whether you're solving puzzles together or conquering obstacles on your own, The Candy Adventure promises an exciting, sugar-filled adventure for players of all ages. Get ready to jump, slide, and solve your way through a world where every corner is packed with sweetness and surprises!",
    "about_the_game": "The candy Adventure<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on a delightful journey in The Candy Adventure, a charming 3D platformer. Join our adorable cake characters as they fall through a mysterious portal and find themselves in magical and unexpected locations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this sweet-themed adventure, you'll navigate through vibrant and colorful worlds, overcoming various challenges to find your way back home. Play solo or team up with a friend in our engaging cooperative mode, where collaboration and teamwork are essential for success.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience a blend of 3D platforming with captivating 2.5D levels, offering a unique twist to each stage. Whether you're solving puzzles together or conquering obstacles on your own, The Candy Adventure promises an exciting, sugar-filled adventure for players of all ages. Get ready to jump, slide, and solve your way through a world where every corner is packed with sweetness and surprises!",
    "short_description": "Dive into The Candy Adventure! Join your friend after falling through a magical portal and getting lost in a world of enchanted sweets. On an epic journey home. Alone or in cooperation, every moment is a delightful surprise. Adventure, friendship and sweetness await you!",
